# target/

Rust build output directory containing compiled artifacts, dependency tracking, and build metadata for the workspace. Organized by build profile (debug, release) and contains intermediate compilation state and toolchain metadata.

## Dirs

- `debug/` -- Rust compiler debug build artifacts including compiled libraries and dependency tracking
- `flycheck0/` -- Temporary IDE syntax-checking directory for real-time error reporting

## Files

- `.cargo-lock` -- Cargo lock file for reproducible build dependency resolution
- `.future-incompat-report.json` -- Report of future Rust compiler incompatibilities in dependencies (num-bigint-dig v0.8.4 uses private vec! macro)
- `.rustc_info.json` -- Rustc metadata and configuration information for the build
- `CACHEDIR.TAG` -- Cache directory tag per https://bford.info/cachedir/ specification
